  "prefLabel": "Lab 1402.18 Flagger",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lab 1402.18 “Flagger” means all personnel, including uniformed police officers, who conducts temporary traffic control (TTC) on roads where 2 lanes of vehicle traffic have been reduced to one lane.\n\nSource. #4118 eff 8-22-86, EXPIRED: 8-22-92\n\nNew. #6684, eff 2-4-98, EXPIRED: 2-4-06\n\nNew. #8606, INTERIM, eff 4-12-06, EXPIRED: 10-09-06\n\nNew. #10809, eff 4-9-15; ss by #14431, eff 11-22-25, EXPIRES: 11-22-35 (formerly Lab 1402.04)",
